  {
   "text": "EXACTLY WHAT WE’VE BEEN WARNING ABOUT\n\nWhat will it take for Speaker Johnson to bring the House back and deal with it? AI ISN’T WAITING FOR CONGRESS.\n\n📌 OpenAI says its agents accessed federal government sites. Researchers say an agent also attempted to breach the Education Department’s website.",
