  },
  {
   "text": "The problem isn't rogue #AI models, it's *negligent companies*.\nIf a biomedical firm put their product in public water supply because they wanted to test it 'in the real world', they'd be treated as criminal at corporate & individual level.\n\nwww.theguardian.com/technology/2...",
